    requests: 'Legacy amount/action fields permitted only in explicit optional assertions envelope, exact compare to computed server facts/conclusions; mismatch 409 assertion_mismatch, unknown-vs-number mismatch rejects. No quiet discard or authoritative legacy fallback.',
    nativeBuild: 'Root captures current full G legacy request/return interfaces/schemas into explicit frozen-native-reference as already practiced for R4DEF; Node service type imports stay legacy. Controller adapter discriminates inputVersion: legacy reference branch uses frozen original; server-derived-v1 returns clear 422 reference_runtime_unsupported unless real Node producer is intentionally implemented. New Rust never serves legacy reference authority.',
    responseBuild: 'Shared view can be explicit union ServerDerivedV1 | deprecated FrozenLegacyReference; generated Angular clients narrow by outputVersion/producerVersion and never treat absent discriminator as official current. Node reference legacy rows have producer_version=0 and cannot write G head or appear certified. Freeze this intentional Node/Rust difference and run Native build, Rust build, full contract/client checks.' },
  minimumUI: ['Existing operating-overview workspace adds preparation empty/setup state and sourceRows table with IDs/versions/eligibility, scoped projection and real repair links', 'Activate adopted baseline from approved project estimate chain; choose actual source refs and reason, no amount editor', 'Classify every new current cost candidate include/exclude with role/evidence/reason; unknown/stale/source conflict blocks submit and reloads preparation', 'Create realtime snapshot and month/ISO-week closing from exact same form; show final server action, sourceHash and four independent stage bindings', 'History drawer opens original frozen context and later restatement side-by-side, actual late-source differences/reason; corrections route through existing real E/F forms under governed transaction', 'Receipt confirmation/historical-basis action selects exact original terms/currency evidence and shows gross vs derived net/tax; no direct net input', 'No duplicate policy in browser; loading/conflict/403/missing basis/unknown values versus zero and labor masks remain explicit'],
  rootOwnedPromotions: ['Canonical semantics/query freeze for existing G/C/H operations, total32 receipt=0 preview=0 new route', 'SQL-first migration+ORM mapping for target-schema.sql; exact FK/deferred immutable checks and FI cleanup resource inventory', 'Shared context/hash helpers+H schema, source DTOs/spec/client and narrow frozen Native compatibility adapter', 'Minimal R5 and controlled stage source interfaces plus I final condition closure freeze; G must consume real source facts'],
