        "$ref": "#/$defs/OperatingRestatementSummary"
      },
      "successStatus": 200,
      "inputVersion": null
    }
  ],
  "expectedVersions": {
    "expectedVersion": "Mandatory project_operating_head.row_version, 0 means no prior head; field is never optional",
    "expectedProjectVersion": "Mandatory positive actual project.row_version under project lock",
    "references": "Every supplied identity requires positive expectedVersion+payloadHash; decision expectedVersion=0 only means no current decision",
    "expectedInputHash": "Preparation factual input hash BEFORE new classification/correction producer writes. Recompute after all locks; mismatch 409.",
    "finalSourceHash": "H factual whitelist AFTER actual classification/membership/source-state transitions; distinct from expectedInputHash. Generated IDs/time policy exclusions follow H proposal exactly."
  },
  "interface": {
    "sharedContext": "Consume H/final-g1/source-context.schema.json; Root owns final shared model/canonical serializer",
    "collect": "pub async fn collect_with_session(session:&mut CommonSession<'_, '_>, plan:&OperatingCollectPlan, lock_mode:CollectLockMode, actor:&Actor)->Result<OperatingCollection,Error>",
    "prepare": "pub async fn prepare_with_session(session:&mut CommonSession<'_, '_>, project_id:Uuid, intent:&OperatingPreparationIntent, actor:&Actor)->Result<OperatingPreparation,Error>",
    "loadFrozen": "pub async fn load_frozen_context_with_session(session:&mut CommonSession<'_, '_>, snapshot_id:Uuid, expected_row_version:i32, expected_source_hash:&str)->Result<OperatingSourceContext,Error>",
    "derive": "project_operating_signals::derive_operating_evaluation(&context,None)",
    "readiness": "project_operating_signals::derive_cost_readiness(&context)",
    "evaluate": "project_operating_signals::evaluate_with_session(session,snapshot_id,1,&source_hash,actor)->Result<OperatingEvaluationRefs,Error>",
    "sequence": [
      "Discover complete impacted project set without acquiring a partial set of locks; sorted project UUID locks; rediscover and restart on new scope",
      "Lock head/baseline/contract/receipt and all source-family/source/cost/F governance rows in shared deterministic order; assert all versions and expectedInputHash",
      "Apply real receipt certification/labor/allocation correction producer calls only when explicitly requested and authorized; persist explicit classifications; CAS direct cost included transition; preserve actual source-state before/after proof",
      "Allocate target snapshot/context UUIDs server-side; collect exact post-producer immutable context and sourceRows; calculate exact primary facts; H pure derive owns action/readiness",
      "Reject formalEligibility missing-evidence; write G source context/members and snapshot with final action once at captured row version 1",
      "For period: write paired period anchor with exactly same source context; for restatement: append restatement+causal links and metadata-only old terminal supersede",
      "H evaluate reloads real new context/hash/v1, recomputes/asserts final facts/action and writes DMER/OSER/four binding/summary chains; no G facts writeback",
      "CAS project_operating_head/new period terminal pointers, required business audit/security/auth coflush, one outer COMMIT; any necessary write failure rolls back all"
    ]
  },
  "baselineOnlySequence": "activateOperatingBaselinePackage validates only adopted estimate/approved transition/handover provenance and freezes operating_baseline_source; it does not require receipts/cost classifications or create a fake ProjectOperatingSnapshot/H evaluation. Its sourceContextId is a baseline evidence ID, not an OperatingSourceContext row. Snapshot creation separately applies the full G/H pipeline.",
  "baselineAmounts": "originalBaselineCost = earliest formally adopted PROJECT estimate net; handoverBaselineCost = exact adopted handover effective project estimate net (or original when no absorbed rebaseline); executionChangePackageTotal = sum approved post-execution successor net minus predecessor net once each; changePackageTotal compatibility = handoverBaselineCost-originalBaselineCost+executionChangePackageTotal; currentEffectiveBaselineCost=handoverBaselineCost+executionChangePackageTotal. Keep all components distinct in source payload/UI; original never overwritten.",
  "collector": {
    "contracts": "As-of effective complete contract set with exact activated term/preparation/readiness/review bindings; net from immutable terms, currency from certified immutable activation-baseline/contract linkage; no single-contract shortcut or signed gross used as net",
    "receipts": "Confirmed same-project receipts by true receiptDate <= business cutoff; every required row must have immutable v1 receipt_accounting_basis. Gross cash for progress ratio; net for margin. No missing-basis exclusion toggle.",
    "costs": "All real registered/current source rows partitioned by actual include/exclude producer; unknown/unclassified remains visible and not implicit zero. Included direct nodes need captured E source facts + active verified F stage and known net currency; payment installments are distinct actual payment IDs.",
    "sourceChains": "Server constructs canonicalAccumulationKey from actual primary source identity/lineage and sourceChainKey from real payable link. Invoice/tax-support/evidence-only must exclude primary money; controlled explicit supportingSourceRefs creates actual append-only source link+reason, never amount/date heuristics. Included procurement promise excludes any absorbed same-chain payment principal; no triple counting.",
    "allocations": "Use actual F basis/result/source snapshots, exact stored selected-measurement-first-v2 cents/layers. No synthetic ProjectActualCostRecord. Result version and each real source/stage lineage frozen; shared source full amount and same share source-set mutually exclusive; direct source unrelated same-payable installments remain valid.",
    "baseline": "One adopted PROJECT technical-cost chain, counted once even across many contracts; original earliest approved adopted package immutable. Current handover cost from exact before/after basis verified chain; execution change delta = approved successor project cost version net minus predecessor net, each transition once. Contract gross/signed delta never cost delta. Forked/disconnected/conflicting adopted project packages reject.",
    "tax": "Active F tax snapshots/evidence, deductible VAT excluded from base; non-deductible adjustment only when explicit source component not already included; pending remains unknown/pending, never automatic addition of all taxImpactAmount",
    "labor": "yes if any transitive member is labor; no only if all lineage verified non-labor; otherwise unknown and strongest reversible projection/write guards",
    "zero": "Known zero only exhaustive source-scope zero or authorized explicit exclusions with proofs; money knowledge separate from maturity/evaluation. Missing confirmed receipt basis or included hard evidence prevents official publish."
  },
  "inclusion": {
    "persistence": "Append project_cost_inclusion_decision + CAS project_cost_inclusion_head. Per-snapshot operating_snapshot_cost_member immutable; copying same actual decision into later snapshot does not reinclude or reprice it.",
    "directProducer": "UPDATE project_actual_cost_record SET record_status='included',is_included_in_project_cost=true,included_at=now(),included_by=actor,row_version=row_version+1 WHERE id=... AND row_version=expected AND record_status='confirmed' AND NOT is_included_in_project_cost RETURNING ...; exactly one row, after real qualification.",
    "includedMeaning": "Sticky consumed-ever fact; never reset flag/status to confirmed merely to bypass E/F guards. Live inclusion head can only change through explicit restatement when previously published inclusion changes. Replaced old record remains historical flag=true,status=replaced; original membership never changes.",
    "sharedProducer": "Do not flip confirmed shared pool source to included as full direct cost. CAS actual F result is_included_in_project_cost=true/included_at/by and increment result row_version, record causal metadata transition; membership consumes only result project share.",
    "exclusion": "Unconsumed candidate exclude creates reasoned classification only, no included cost flag; explicit registered/no-stage exclusion is pending/not-yet-applicable and H retains gap. New source candidates cannot disappear from exhaustive scope.",
    "ordinaryReplacement": "E direct labor replace, F stage/tax/whole-allocation replace and C source mutation must check actual consumed membership; normal paths return 409 operating_restatement_required if changing a consumed factual component. No fake reset/uninclude.",
    "restatementReplacement": "Existing operating-restatements handles live or period roots. Sealed internal RestatementPermit is produced only after true referenced snapshots/source hashes/versions and full affected-project set are locked. It allows actual E labor recalculation and F complete-batch replacement using real business inputs, fresh stage/source proof, predecessor links and all necessary G/H restatements atomically. It is never a client boolean.",
    "bound": "Unsupported non-labor source correction stays blocked until its real upstream producer exists; G accepts only actual corrected source IDs/versions, never correction money. Do not invent a refund/source row or certify a fixture."
  },
  "periodPolicy": {
    "timezone": "Asia/Hong_Kong (existing business pipeline); do not change DB timezone",
    "acceptedKeys": "Valid actual YYYY-MM or ISO YYYY-Www, reject impossible week 53 and future unfinished period",
    "accumulation": "Cumulative project inception through periodEnd; sourceWindowStart=null explicitly means all history, sourceWindowEnd=periodEnd. UI says cumulative, not period-only increment.",
    "capture": "knowledgeCutoff is actual coherent source collection time; normal closing uses then-known effective producers; original period context never rewritten",
    "laterFacts": "Restatement retains exact old business cutoff, advances knowledgeCutoff, names actual late/corrected producers; historical status/source histories must be reconstructible or publication rejects",
    "shared": "Normal freeze requires actual F result already effective and all real source members in scope. Explicit restatement may adopt later-effective full F batch when every member actually occurred by old cutoff, marked late-recognized with both dates. Cross-cutoff mixed batch cannot be partially inferred; needs actual F period-split producer or missing-evidence."
  },
  "receiptBasis": {
    "route": "Existing POST /api/receipt-records/{id}:confirm / ContractFinanceController_confirmReceiptRecord, 200",
    "targetDto": "ConfirmReceiptRecordRequest in target-dto.schema.json, mandatory expectedVersion",
    "confirm": "pending-confirmation only; exact selected real same-contract activated terms + currency evidence + expected versions; derive cents_net=HALF_UP(gross_cents*10000/(10000+rate4)), tax=gross-net; insert immutable basis and CAS receipt confirmed in caller outerTX with audit/auth",
    "historicalCertification": "mode certify-existing-basis requires status confirmed and no existing basis; explicit original same-contract terms/currency evidence, actor/reason/evidence refs, scoped attachment/activation validation; do not change receiptAmount/date/status/confirmedAt/confirmedBy. CAS receipt row_version+1, append basis+create audit atomically. No infer-from-current-rate, no zero backfill.",
    "snapshotSelection": "UI default can nominate uniquely proven receipt-date effective snapshot. Otherwise operator must explicitly select actual previously activated terms and documentary evidence; server verifies identity/version/hash and actual approval lineage, never chooses latest/current silently. A legacy term missing tax/currency authority cannot be repaired by guessing in this command.",
    "currency": "Certified activation commercial baseline currency plus same-contract immutable-after-draft currency check; optional new term snapshot currency_code frozen by actual activation for future rows. Legacy rows remain null unless same-command explicit source evidence proves it, never migration mass backfill.",
    "immutable": "Single basis per receipt for this slice. Existing basis re-rate/correction needs a separately authorized correction semantic; reject instead of replacing current-rate basis. Historical operating contexts remain unknown until explicit new restatement consumes basis; no old context backfill."
  },
  "preview": {
    "publicOperation": "Existing H GET /api/projects/{projectId}/unified-accounting",
    "query": "view=preparation&intent=baseline-activation|snapshot-create|period-close|restatement|receipt-basis; optional periodKey/restatesSnapshotId/receiptId must be typed actual IDs",
    "responseAddition": "preparation:OperatingPreparation; official current result separate nullable/typed409; read-only actual G collector + H pure derive if applicable, no business snapshot/classification/R5 fixture created",
    "frontEnd": "Select actual sourceRows and evidence/period/reason, echo real refs/head versions/input hash, submit server-derived-v1. No H policy, tax formula, monetary total or action class calculated in UI."
  },
  "compatibility": {
    "shared": "Root promotes new discriminator DTOs, concrete 201 results, knowledge/projection types and all generated client/spec updates together. Legacy raw fields are deprecated compatibility outputs; Rust v1 returns null there if retained, never a second authority.",
    "requests": "Legacy amount/action fields permitted only in explicit optional assertions envelope, exact compare to computed server facts/conclusions; mismatch 409 assertion_mismatch, unknown-vs-number mismatch rejects. No quiet discard or authoritative legacy fallback.",
    "nativeBuild": "Root captures current full G legacy request/return interfaces/schemas into explicit frozen-native-reference as already practiced for R4DEF; Node service type imports stay legacy. Controller adapter discriminates inputVersion: legacy reference branch uses frozen original; server-derived-v1 returns clear 422 reference_runtime_unsupported unless real Node producer is intentionally implemented. New Rust never serves legacy reference authority.",
    "responseBuild": "Shared view can be explicit union ServerDerivedV1 | deprecated FrozenLegacyReference; generated Angular clients narrow by outputVersion/producerVersion and never treat absent discriminator as official current. Node reference legacy rows have producer_version=0 and cannot write G head or appear certified. Freeze this intentional Node/Rust difference and run Native build, Rust build, full contract/client checks."
  },
  "minimumUI": [
    "Existing operating-overview workspace adds preparation empty/setup state and sourceRows table with IDs/versions/eligibility, scoped projection and real repair links",
    "Activate adopted baseline from approved project estimate chain; choose actual source refs and reason, no amount editor",
    "Classify every new current cost candidate include/exclude with role/evidence/reason; unknown/stale/source conflict blocks submit and reloads preparation",
    "Create realtime snapshot and month/ISO-week closing from exact same form; show final server action, sourceHash and four independent stage bindings",
    "History drawer opens original frozen context and later restatement side-by-side, actual late-source differences/reason; corrections route through existing real E/F forms under governed transaction",
    "Receipt confirmation/historical-basis action selects exact original terms/currency evidence and shows gross vs derived net/tax; no direct net input",
    "No duplicate policy in browser; loading/conflict/403/missing basis/unknown values versus zero and labor masks remain explicit"
  ],
  "rootOwnedPromotions": [
    "Canonical semantics/query freeze for existing G/C/H operations, total32 receipt=0 preview=0 new route",
    "SQL-first migration+ORM mapping for target-schema.sql; exact FK/deferred immutable checks and FI cleanup resource inventory",
    "Shared context/hash helpers+H schema, source DTOs/spec/client and narrow frozen Native compatibility adapter",
    "Minimal R5 and controlled stage source interfaces plus I final condition closure freeze; G must consume real source facts"
  ],
  "acceptance": [
    "Real signed contracts/readiness/activated terms plus actual gross receipts -> certified basis -> E actual cost -> F real stage/allocation/tax -> explicit G classifications -> G v1 snapshot -> H actual four-stage producers -> real I/R5 consumer",
    "Expected versions/hash and duplicate/current/period/successor concurrency reject coherently; share replacement includes every impacted project target",
    "Fault each direct cost CAS/shared result CAS/classification/head/member/context/snapshot/period/restatement/H/audit/auth write; whole outerTX rollback (pre-existing independent auth raw touch label preserved)",
    "Original period/member/source payload hashes immutable after true backdated producer correction and restatement; no historical current-source reinterpretation",
    "Exact cents/tax HALF_UP; all-classified excluded zero versus unknown; source-chain no duplicate promise/payment/invoice; same project estimate reused by multiple contracts counted once; selected F cents never recomputed ratios",
    "Native build+Angular build/client regeneration required after Root compatibility promotion; actual UI source selection and historical certification, all sensitive permission combinations"
  ]
}

99f015126999a486ac2e1b4da73cd41cd345eb0c blob 4441
{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "status": "FINAL-G1-TARGET-PROPOSAL-NOT-ADMITTED",
  "base": "proposal01.json",
  "inputHashExactWhitelist": {
    "algorithm": "contract_support::canonical_hash of this exact object, with set-like arrays sorted kind/id/rowVersion/payloadHash",
    "fields": {
      "schemaVersion": 1,
      "projectId": "real scoped project UUID",
      "intent": "baseline-activation|snapshot-create|period-close|restatement|receipt-basis",
      "projectRowVersion": "positive real version",
      "head": "{rowVersion,baselinePackageId|null,currentSnapshotId|null}",
      "businessScope": "{mode,periodKey|null,businessCutoff,restatesSnapshotRef|null,periodEndSnapshotRef|null}",
      "sourceRows": "[{sourceKind,id,rowVersion,payloadHash,currentClassificationHeadRef|null}] for complete actual source/transitive evidence set before new writes"
    },
    "exclude": ["financial projection modes/user identity", "prepare generated UUID", "preparedAt/transport timestamps", "client-proposed decisions not yet committed", "new snapshot/context/random IDs", "policy conclusions"],
    "compare": "After all actual scope/source locks but before G/E/F classification or correction writes, recompute and require request expectedInputHash equality; 409 on mismatch. New client decisions have their own exact expected target/decision versions, identity/scope/evidence validation.",
    "postProducer": "Only after actual classification IDs, direct included CAS and shared-result included CAS exist, collect final immutable context and compute H sourceHash factual whitelist. External expectedInputHash and internal evaluate expected_source_hash are deliberately different authorities."
  },
  "inputRefKindNarrowing": {
    "originalAdoptedCostRef": ["ProjectTechnicalCostPackage"],
    "baselinePackageRef": ["OperatingBaselinePackage"],
    "selectedHandoverBasisRef": ["ProjectHandoverBasisSnapshot"],
    "handoverRebaselineRef": ["ContractHandoverRebaselineRecord"],
    "approvedChangeRefs": ["ContractTermSnapshot", "ContractAmendment", "ContractTermPreparation"],
    "costDecisionTarget": ["ProjectActualCostRecord", "SharedCostAllocationResult"],
    "termSnapshotRef": ["ContractTermSnapshot"],
    "currencyBasisRef": ["CommercialReleaseBaseline", "ContractTermSnapshot"],
    "rule": "Each route field uses this registered finite kind dispatch, verifies actual table/scope/version/hash, and never constructs SQL identifiers from a client kind. Evidence kinds further use the existing attachment/source authority registry."
  },
  "captureVersusLaterReview": "G snapshot currentActionLevel is final policy action AT CAPTURE. H later manual-review effective action is separate source-linked overlay; no G snapshot writeback. New UI must label capture action and current effective review result separately rather than implying old fixed facts changed.",
  "baselineOnlyContext": "OperatingBaselinePackageSummary.sourceContextId identifies operating_baseline_source, not a fake full OperatingSourceContext with nonexistent snapshot or missing receipts. Full contexts and H evaluate exist only for actual snapshots.",
  "currencyVersionAuthority": "Use actual CommercialReleaseBaseline rowVersion through exact term source_baseline_id, or a new actually-activated ContractTermSnapshot whose nonnull currency_code is frozen and hashed. Do not claim an independent rowVersion on ProjectHandoverContractBasis, which has no such column; its parent basis/version is supporting evidence only. Legacy null term currency needs real original baseline evidence or remains unknown.",
  "sqlCheckNullSemantics": "target-schema.sql verified-producer CHECK conditions explicitly require every nullable newly-added authority column IS NOT NULL; PostgreSQL CHECK UNKNOWN must not bypass v1 certification.",
  "deferredChecksCompletionBoundary": "target-schema.sql defines columns/FKs/uniques and explicitly enumerates mandatory cross-row/deferred checks. Root promotion must implement those SQL trigger/service predicates and matching ORM/schema checks before G1/G2/acceptance; the tools-only candidate is not an executed complete migration.",
  "upstreamSchemaPin": "sources01.json records H context/proposal bytes observed when this candidate was generated. H is actively finalizing agreed nullable stage/currency/share refinements; Root must pin the final unified bytes in the joint freeze, not silently reuse stale candidate hashes."
}

